{śrīpāñcarātrarakṣā

śrīmadvedāntadeśikapraṇītā}

śrīmān veṅkaṭanāthāryaḥ kavitārkikakesarī |
vedāntācāryavaryo me saṃnidhattaṃ sadā hṛdi ||

{siddhāntavyavasthāpanākhyaḥ}

[prathamo'dhikāraḥ]

[maṅgalācaraṇam] 

cāturvyūhaṃ paraṃ brahma ṣāḍguṇyaparikarmitam |
pañcarātrasya kṛtsnasya prasūtiṃ paryupāsmahe ||

ananyadevatāsthāyinyāyatemahi te vayam |
pañcarātramahāmbhodhipāradṛśvani sajjane ||

ārohantvanavadyatarkapadavīsīmādṛśāṃ mādṛśāṃ 
pakṣe kārtayuge niveśitapadāḥ (padāṃ(-) ca cha padān(-) ka kha 
ga) pakṣe patadbhyaḥ parān |
sarvānuśravasāradarśisaśiraḥkampadvijihvāśana(-)
krīḍākuṇḍalimauliratnadhṛnibhiḥ sārātrikāḥ sūktayaḥ ||

pāñcarātra prāmāṇyam

atra tāvat pratyakṣitasamastavedārthatattvasthitibhiḥ pārāśaryaprabhṛtibhiḥ 
mahābhāratādiṣu bhagavacchāstrasya sārvabhaumaṃ prāmāṇyaṃ pratyapādi | 
śārīrake ca 
kapilakaṇabhakṣabhikṣukṣapaṇakapaśupatisamayapratikṣepasamanantaraṃ 
tantrāntarasahapāṭhādisaṃbhavanmandamativyāmohaśamanāya 
utpattyasaṃbhavāt na ca kartuḥ karaṇam iti sūtrābhyāṃ pūrvapakṣamupakṣipya 
vijñānādibhāve vā tadapratiṣedhaḥ vipratiṣedhācca iti sūtradvayena 
jīvotpattyādyanuktitatpratiṣedhapratipādanadvāreṇa siddhantaḥ samarthitaḥ | 
bhagavadyāmunamunibhirbhāṣyakāraiśca

idaṃ mahopaniṣadaṃ caturvedasamanvitam |
sāṃkhyayogakṛtāntena pañcarātrānuśabditam ||

vedānteṣu yathāsāraṃ saṃgṛhya bhagavān hariḥ |
bhaktānukampayā vidvān saṃcikṣepa yathāsukham ||

ityādipramāṇagaṇapratipāditaprakriyayā 
ativitatagahanagambhīranigamaśataśikharagataparamapuruṣārthatadupāyataditikartav
yatāsaṃgraharūpasya bhagavanmukhodgatasya śāstrasya kāraṇadoṣādyabhāvena 
dvacidapyaprāmāṇyaṃ na śaṅkanīyamiti niraṇāyi | karmakāṇḍe'pi 
pramāṇalakṣaṇe saṃbhavedvadavirodhānāṃ vyāsādyaparigṛhītānāmeva 
smṛtīnāmaprāmāṇyamasūtryat | ye punaścaramayugamīmāṃsakāstantrāntaraiḥ 
samānayogakṣemaṃ sāttvataṃ śāstramabhimanyante teṣāṃ vikatthanāni 
āgamaprāmāṇye nirācakrire | uktaṃ ca(-) 

taccedetacchutipathaparibhraṣṭatantre samānaṃ 
sāṃkhyayogakṛtāntena pañcarātrānuśabditam ||

vedānteṣu yathāsāraṃ saṃgṛhya bhagavān hariḥ |
bhaktānukampayā vidvān saṃcikṣepa yathāsukham ||

ityādipramāṇagaṇapratipātidaprakriyayā 
ativitatagahanagambhīranigamaśataśikharagataparamapuruṣārthatadupāyataditikartav
yatāsaṃgraharūpasya bhagavanmukhodgatasya śāstrasya kāraṇadoṣādyabhāvena 
dvacidapyaprāmāṇyaṃ na śaṅkanīyamiti niraṇāyi | karamakāṇḍe'pi 
pramāṇalakṣaṇe saṃbhadvedavirodhānāṃ vyāsādyaparigṛhītānāmeva 
smṛtīnāmaprāmāṇyamasūtryat | ye punaścaramayugamīmāṃsakāstantrāntaraiḥ 
samānayogakṣemaṃ sāttvataṃ śāstramabhimanyante teṣāṃ vikatthanāni 
āgamaprāmāṇye nirācakrire | uktaṃ ca(-) 

taccedetacchutipathaparibhraṣṭatantraiḥ samānaṃ 
pātṛtvena prasajati tadā somapāste surāpāḥ ||

iti | śūdrārcanādiprasaṅge tvevaṃ pratibandī śrīkṛṣṇamunibhiruktā(-) 

haviṣkṛto yathā śūdre yathā vā bahuyājinaḥ |
nirvāhaḥ kriyate tadvacchāstrasyāsyāpi nānyatha ||

iti | ayamarthaḥ (ṅ: asyārthaḥ)(-) yathā haviṣkṛdādhāveti śūdrasya 
bahuyājino'gārācchūdravarjam ityādivākyeṣu 
karmaviśeṣādhikāramupacāraviśeṣaṃ vā samālambya nirvāhaḥ tadvadihāpīti | 
bhaṭṭārakaiśca tantrāntarebhya idaṃ sārvatrikeṇa prāmāṇyena vyabhajyat(-) 

tasmāt sāṃkhyaṃ sayogaṃ sapaśupatimataṃ kutracit pañcarātraṃ
sarvatraiva pramāṇaṃ tadidamavagataṃ pañcamādeva vedāt ||

catvārḥ siddhantāḥ 

iti | tadetat mahato vedavṛkṣasya mūlabhūto mahānayam 
ityadyuktānantaśākhāśrayaṛgādiskandhabhiduranigamatarumūlabhāgopabṛṃ
haṇarūpaṃ svamūlanigamabhāgabhedāt (gh: bhāgabhedavadṛgādi) 
ṛgādideva cardhāvatiṣṭhate(-) āgamasiddhantaḥ mantrasiddhantaḥ 
tantrasiddhantaḥ tantrāntarasiddhanta iti |

siddhantānām asāṃkaryasthāpanam

catvāraścaite siddhantā ṛgādivadeva śākhābhedairavāntaratantrairbhidyante | 
tatra yathā ṛgādayo vedabhedāḥ tattacchākhābhedāśca 
pūrvapūrvaparigrahānusāreṇa vyavatiṣṭhante putrādibhiśca parigṛhyante tathā 
(gh: tathātra) siddhantabhedāstadavāntarabhedāśca 
prathamaparigrahānsāreṇa vyavatiṣṭhante | yathā ca (kh: cakāraḥ pustake 
nāsti) vācanikātirikte vedāntaraśākhāntarasūtrāntarasaṃkare doṣaḥ tatheha 
siddhantasaṃkare tantrasaṃkare pratyekatantrāntaḥ (kh: pratiniyata) 
pātiniyatavaikalipkadharmādisaṃkare ca | asaṃkīrṇā ceyaṃ vyavasthā 
(pramāṇāntarasahakṛta ka kha ga ca jha) 
pramāṇasahakṛtapāraṃparyaparyālocanayā vyavasthāpyā | idaṃ ca 
garbhādhānādidāhāntasaṃskārāntarasevanāt (saṃskārāsevanāt cha ja) 
bhāgavatānāmabrāhmaṇyaṃ pūrvapakṣiṇā prasañjitaṃ 
pariharadbhirabhagavadyāmunamunibhirarthataḥ samarthitam(-) yadete (ya ete 
ka kha ga ca cha ja jh) vaṃśaparaṃparayā vājasaneyaśākhāmadhīyānāḥ  
kātyāyanādigṛhyoktamārgeṇa garbhādhānādisaṃskārān kurvate | ye punaḥ 
sāvitryanuvacanaprabhṛtitrayīdharmatyāgena (dharmātyagena 
nyāyapariśuddhau pāṭhaḥ) ekāyanaśrutivihitāneva catvāriṃśatsaṃskārān 
kurvate (anutiṣṭhanti ka kha ga ca) te'pi svaśākhāgṛhyoktamarthaṃ 
yathāvadanutiṣṭhamānā na  śākhāntarīyakarmānanuṣṭhānāt brāhmaṇyāt 
pracyavante anyeṣāmapi 
paraśākhāvihitakarmānanuṣṭhānanimittābrāhmaṇyaprasaṅgāt | sarvatra 
(sarve hi ja) hi jāticaraṇagotrādhikārādivyavasthitā eva samācārā 
upalabhyante | yadyapi sarvaśākhāpratyayamekaṃ karma(,) tathāpi 
parasparavilakaṣaṇādhikārisaṃbaddha dharmā na dvacit samuccīyante | 
vilakṣaṇāśca 
trayīvihitasvargaputrādiviṣayopabhogasādhanaindrāgneyādikarmādhikāribhyo 
dvijebhyaḥ 
trayyantaikāyanaśrutivihitavijñānābhigamanopādānejyāprabhṛtibhagavatprāpty
ekopāyakarmādhikāriṇo mumukṣavo brāhmṇā iti 
nobhayeṣāmapyanyonyaśākhāvihitakarmānanuṣṭhānamabrāhmaṇyamāpādayati | 
yathā caikāyanaśākhāyā apauruṣeyatvaṃ tathā kāśmīrāgamaprāmāṇya eva 
prapañcitamiti neha prastūyate | prakṛtānāṃ tu bhāgavatānāṃ 
sāvitryanuvacanāditrayīdharmasaṃbandhasya sphuṭataramupalabdhiḥ na 
tattyaganimittavrātyatvādisaṃdehaṃ sahate iti |

atra vijñānaśabdena saṃvitsiddhyādiṣu svayameva sthāpitaṃ viśiṣṭaṃ jñānaṃ 
vivikṣitam | āha hi(-) 

yathā colanṛpaḥ samrāḍadvitīyo'sti bhūtale |
iti tattulyanṛpatinivāraṇaparaṃ vacaḥ ||

na tu tatputrabhṛtyakalatrādinivāraṇam |
tathā surāsuranarabrahmāṇḍaśatakoṭayaḥ ||

kleśakarmavipākādyairaspṛṣṭasyākhileśituḥ |
jñānādiṣāḍguṇyanidheracintyavibhavasya tāḥ ||

viṣṇorvibhūtimahimasamudradrapsavipruṣuḥ (g: lavavipruṣaḥ; ka ca jha : 
jalavipruṣaḥ) 

iti |

imaṃ ca vedabhedaṃ bhojarājabaladevācāryādayaśca viviñcate (-)

yo vedavṛkṣaṃ bahumūlaśākhaṃ nānāphalārthidvijasaṃghasevyam |
pūrśravānuśravabhedabhinnamāropayattaṃ(āropayantaṃ ka kha ca jha) 
puruṣaṃ rapadye ||

ityādibhiḥ | evaṃ ca sarvatrāsamkaraḥ saṃgraheṇa pradarśitaḥ śrīsāttvate (-)

na śāstrārthasya śāstrāṇāṃ buddhipurva upaplavaḥ |
ācartavya ihājñānāt (ihājñātvā gha cha) pāramparyakramaṃ vinā || 

iti | askhalitapāraṃparyapratyabhijñāneṣu (sthāneṣu added gha ṅ) 
paridṛśyamānapramāṇamūlāni ācāraparaṃparāparigṛhītāni ca karmāṇi na 
mātrayāpi parityājyāni (parihāpyāni ka ga gha ṅ ca cha ja) na ca 
tadviruddhanyupādeyānītyuktaṃ bhavati |

śrīpauṣkare ca adhikārinirūpaṇādhyāye pratiniyatādhikāriviṣayasiddhāntānām 
tvābhiprāyeṇaiva siddhantabhedastadavāntarabhedaśca darśitaḥ | asāṃkarye 
pauṣkaravacanāni yathā(-) 

kartavyatvena vai yatra cāturātmyamupāsyate |
kramāgataiḥ svasaṃjñābhirbrāhmaṇairāgamaṃ tu tat ||

viddhi siddhantasaṃjñaṃ ca tat pūrvamatha pauṣkara |
nānāvyūhasametaṃ ca mūrtidvādaśakaṃ hi tat ||

tathā mūrtyantarayutaṃ prādurbhāvagaṇaṃ hi yat |
prādurbhāvāntarayutaṃ dhṛtaṃ hṛtapdmapūrvake (tat patmapūrvake 
ja) || 

lakṣmyādiśaṅkhacakrā(cakrākhyā gha)khyagārutmyasadigīśvaraiḥ |
sagaṇairastraniṣṭhaiśca tadviddhi kamalodbhava ||

mantrasiddhāntasaṃjñaṃ ca śāstraṃ sarvaphalapradam |
vinā mūrticatuṣkeṇa yatrānyadupacaryate ||

mantreṇa bhagavadrūpaṃ kevalaṃ vāṅgasaṃvṛtam |
yuktaṃ śriyādikenaiva kāntāvyūhena pauṣkara ||

bhinnairābharaṇairastrairāvṛtaṃ ca savigrahaiḥ |
tantrasaṃjñaṃ hi tacchāstraṃ parijñeyaṃ hi cābjaja ||

(mūlyānavṛtti gha) mukhyānuvṛttibhedena yatra siṃhādayastu vai |
catustridvyādikenaiva yogenābhyarthitena tu ||

saṃvṛtāḥ parivāreṇa svena svenojjhitāstu vā |
yacchavatyārādhitāḥ (ārādhitaṃ ka kha ga jha) sarvaṃ viddhi 
tantrāntaraṃ tu tat ||

evaṃ nānāgamānāṃ ca sāmānyaṃ viddhi sarvadā |
nāmadvayaṃ vā (dvayaṃ ca gha ṅ ca cha ja) siddhantaṃ pañcarātreti 
pauṣkare ||

ekaikaṃ bahubhirbhedairāmūlādeva saṃsthitam |
nānāśayavaśenaiva siddhadyaiḥ prakaṭikṛtam ||

saṃkṣiptaṃ sapraprañcaṃ ca tṛtīyamubhayātmakam |
setihāsapurāṇaistu vedairvedāntasaṃyutaiḥ ||

ye janmakoṭibhiḥ siddhasteṣāmante'tra saṃsthitiḥ |

iti | atra ekaikasya siddhantasyāmulādeva bahubhirbhedaiḥ saṃsthitatvavacanāt 
caturṇāṃ siddhāntānāṃ tadavāntaratantrabhedānāṃ ca 
siddhāntaratantrāntarasaṃkaraparihāreṇaiva sarvadāvasthānaṃ sūcitam |

caturṇāmapi siddhantānāṃ mokṣapradatvam

atra ca (cakāraḥ pustakeṣu nāsti kha ga ja jha) 
siddhantasaṃjñitānāmeṣāṃ caturṇāmai mokṣapradatvamanantaramevoktam (-)

tasmāt (yasmāt ṅ ca) samyak paraṃ brahma vāsudevākhyamavyayam |
etasmāt prāpyate śāstrāt jñānapūrveṇa karmaṇā ||
siddhāntasaṃjñā viprāsya sārdhakā ata eva hi |

iti | atra sārthakā iti bahuvacanāntasāmānādhikaraṇyāt siddhantasaṃjñāśabdo'pi 
bahuvacanāntaḥ san āgamādiviśeṣaṇayogena caturdhā 
saṃjñāvasthānamabhipraiti | pañcarātraśabdavat siddhantaśabdo'pi caturṇāṃ 
sādhāraṇa iti cātraiva pūrvamuktam | pādmne  ca sadāgamādisiddhantacatuṣke 
satpadaprade iti caturṇāṃ satpadaśabdavācyabhagavatpada(bhagavatprāpti(-) 
kha) prāptisādhanatvamuktam | hayagrīvasaṃhitāyāmapi 
kasyacinmokṣaikāntyam anyeṣāmapi phalāntareṇa saha mokṣapradatvamuktam(-)

āgamākhaṃ hi siddhantaṃ sanmokṣaikaphalapradam |
mantrasaṃjñaṃ hi siddhantaṃ siddhimokṣapradaṃ nṛṇām ||

tantrasaṃjñaṃ tu (saṃjñaṃ hi ka kha ga ṅ ca cha jha) siddhantaṃ 
caturvargaphalapradam |
tantrāntaraṃ hi siddhantaṃ vāñchitārthaphalapradam ||

iti | atra vāñchitārthaśabdenāviśeṣāt trivargavadapavargo'pi saṃgṛhyate | ata 
eṣāṃ caturṇāmapi parabrahmabhūtavāsudevaprāpakatvāt 
apavargārthibhirmokṣopāyopadeśapradeśeṣu (upadeśa ka kha ga jha kośeṣu 
nāsti) vikalpo'viśiṣṭaphalatvāt iti nyāyena 
sadakṣaradaharamadhubhūmavaiśvānaraśāṇḍilyanāciketopakosalapratardanasaṃv
argāntarādityānandamayavidyādiṣviva vaikalpikaḥ parigrahḥ | 
brahmasvarūpanirūpakadharmavyatiriktānāṃ tattadvidyāpratiniyataguṇānāṃ yathā 
vidhāsu parasaramanupasaḥāraḥ tathātrāpīti pratyekaṃ partiniyatānāṃ 
prakriyāṇāṃ parasparāsaṃkareṇa prayogaḥ siddhaḥ | yatra tu madhuvidyādau 
vamupadaprāptyādipūrvakabrahmaprāptivat paraṃparayā 
vāsudevaprāptirabhidhīyate tatrāpi 
tattadarvācīnaparvavyahitaparaprāptikāmānāmadhikāra 
(kāmanāyāmadhikāraḥ gha) iti vyavasthā | tadabhiprāyeṇa coktaṃ 
bhāṣye taddhi vāsudevākhyaṃ paraṃ brahma saṃpūrṇaṣāḍguṇyavapuḥ 
sūkṣmavyūhabibhavabhedabhinnaṃ yathādhikāraṃ bhaktairjñānapūrveṇa 
karmaṇābhyarcitaṃ samyak prāpyate | vibhavārcanāt vyūhaṃ prāpya vyūhārcanāt 
paraṃ brahma vāsudevākhyaṃ sūkṣmaṃ prāpyat iti vadanti iti | 
ataścaturṇāmapyapavarge tātparyam | phalāntarasādhanavacanasyānyārthatvaṃ 
svayamevoktam (uktaṃ pauṣkare gha) pratyayārthaṃ ca mokṣasya 
siddhayaḥ saṃprakīrtitāḥ iti | evaṃ caturṇāmapi mokṣapradatve hi (siddhe hi 
gha) trayyantasāropabṛṃhaṇarūpatvamapi samañjasaṃ bhavati |

siddhāntasaṃkare tantrasaṃkare ca pādmavacana vicāraḥ

pādme caryāpāde caturṇāmeteṣāṃ parasparavibhāgaḥ siddhāntasaṃkare 
tantrasaṃkare ca doṣaḥ prapañcitaḥ |

taccaturdhā sthitaṃ śāstramṛgādivadanekadhā |
ekaikaṃ bhityate tantraṃ śākhābhedena bhūyasā ||

prathamaṃ mantrasiddhantaṃ dvitīyaṃ cāmamāhvayam |
tṛtīyaṃ tantrasiddhantaṃ turyaṃ tantrāntaraṃ bhavet ||

iti | atra āgamamantrasiddhāntayoḥ pauṣkaroktakramāt vyutkrameṇopādānaṃ 
siddhimokṣapradamantrasiddhantaprāśastye tātparyāt | atrāpi hi āgamasiddhantasya 
kevalamokṣapradatvalakṣaṇo'tiśayaḥ (atiśayaḥ ka kha ga jha kośeṣu 
nāsti) karmaṇāmapi saṃnyāsaḥ kathyate yatra cāgame iti pardarśita eva | atra 
kāmyakarmaṇā svarūpataḥ saṃnyāsaḥ svavarṇāśramādiniyatānāṃ 
(svavarṇāśraniyatānāṃ ka kha ga ca jha) tu 
bhagadgītāṣṭādaśādhyāyanirṇītaprakāreṇa sāttvikatyāgaḥ 
svaśākhāgṛhyoktamaryādayā ca sarvatra nityanaimittikādiparigrahaḥ | ata 
āgamasiddhānte sarvakarmasvarūpatyāg iti na bharmitavyam 
karmaviśeṣabhūyastvāt | ata eva hi tanniṣṭhanadhikṛtyoktam (-)

trayodaśavidhaṃ karma kāmādiparivarjitam |
guṇaiḥ sāṃyamikairyuktamanutiṣṭhanti sādhavaḥ ||

iti | atraivoddiṣṭakrameṇa catvāraḥ siddhantā yakṣyante(-)

siddhantānāṃ pādmoktaṃ lakṣaṇam

ekaiva mūrtirārādhyā prādhānyenetarāḥ punaḥ |
devyaḥ śriyādayaścāpi saṃpūjyāḥ parivāravat ||

āyudhaiḥ śaṅkacakrādyaiḥ śrīvastādyaiśca bhūṣaṇaiḥ |
mūrtimadbhiḥ parivṛtā kevalā vāmbujāsana ||

kathyate yatra tat prokta mantrasiddhantamagrimam |
vāsudevādayo vyūhāścatvāraḥ sādhakairapi ||

(kramāgatāḥ gha) kramāgataistulyakakṣyāḥ pūjyāstu 
(kakṣyāpūjyāstu ka ga ṅ jha) prabhavāpye |
karmaṇāpi saṃnyāsaḥ kathyate yatra cāgame ||

tantramāgamasiddhantaṃ taduktaṃ kamalāsana |
navānāmapi mūrtīnāṃ prādhānyaṃ yatra kathyate ||

mūrtiyo dvādaśāṅgāni teṣāmeva tathāpare |
prādurbhāvagaṇāścāpi mūrtyantaragaṇā api ||

prādurbhāvāntarayutāḥ sadigdevaiḥ (saha devaiḥ ja) sayāyudhaiḥ |
mūrtimadbhiśca devībhirlakṣmyādibhirapi sphuṭam ||

tat tantrasiddhantāhvānaṃ caturthaṃ paramaṃ punaḥ |
saumyasiṃhādibhūyiṣṭhavaktrabhedaiścaturmukha ||

dvitryādimukhabhedā vā mūrtirekaiva pūjyate |
saṃvṛtā parivāraiḥ svarvinā vā sarvakāmadā ||

yatra tantrāntaraṃ tat syāccaturthaṃ caturānana |
yena siddhantamārgeṇa karṣaṇādikriyā kṛtā ||

ādau tenaiva sakalā nānyasiddhantavartmanā |
tantrāntare'pi kathitamanuktaṃ grāhyameva hi ||

siddhantasaṃkarastasmāt tantrasaṃkara eva ca |
doṣāya kalpate rājarāṣṭradhāmakṣayātmane ||

sīddhāntasaṃkare jāte pramādāt tasya śāntaye |
kṛtvā saṃprokṣaṇaṃ pūrvaṃ sahasrakalaśāplavaḥ ||

kartavyaḥ snapanaṃ kuryāt tantrasaṃkarasaṃbhave |
ante mahotsavaṃ kuryād dhvajārohaṇapūrvakam ||

iti | atra pādmoktatantra(tantra gha kośe nāsti)tantrāntaralakṣaṇaṃ 
pauṣkaroktāvirodhena netavyam | yadi dvayorgranthayoraikārthyaṃ saṃbhavati tadā 
na virodhaḥ | itarathā tantratantrāntaralakṣaṇaṃ (itaratantreṣu 
abhyupagamasiddhantatantratantrāntaralakṣaṇaṃ ka kha ga) 
dviprakāramanusaṃgheyam | yathā nyāyavistare 
sarvatantrapratitantrābhyupagamādhārasiddhanteṣu abhyupagamasiddhantasya dvedhā 
lakṣaṇamakṣapādābhipretaṃ varṇayanti(-)

sādhitaḥ paratantre yaḥ svatantre ca samāśritaḥ (samāhitaḥ ja) |
sa hyabhupagamo nyāye (nāyo ka jha) manaso'namatiryathā ||

dadviśeṣaparīkṣā vā sadbhāve'nyatra sādhite |
yathānyatra manaḥsitthau (siddhaṃ ka jha) tasyākṣatvaparīkṣaṇam ||

iti | pārameśvaroktaṃ tantratantrāntaralakṣaṇaṃ tu pauṣkaroktena samānameva 
(pauṣkaroktasamānameva gha ja) | tathāhi prāyaścittādhyāye 
saṃkarādidoṣaparihārārthaṃ vibhajyamāneṣu siddhanteṣu 
āgamamantrasiddhantaprapañcanāntaramucyate (-)

paravyūhādibhedena vinaikaikena mūrtinā |
sāṅgena kevalenātha kāntāvyūhena bhūṣaṇaiḥ ||

tathāstrairvigrahopetairāvartaṃ tantrasaṃjñitam |
nṛsiṃhakapilakroḍahaṃsavātīśvarādayaḥ ||

mukhyādivṛttibhedena devalā vāṅgasaṃyutāḥ |
cakrādyastravaraiścātha bhūṣaṇairmakuṭādibhiḥ ||

kāntāgaṇaiśca yakṣmyādyaiḥ parivāraiḥ khagādibhiḥ |
pūjitā vidhinā yatra tat tantrāntaramīritam ||

iti | tadeva vyavasthiteṣu siddhanteṣu saṃkaraparihāraḥ pādme sapṣaṭaḥ | tasminneva 
cādhyāye kvacit siddhante tadavāntaratantrabhede vā dīkṣitasya siddhantaroktāsu 
tantrantaroktāsu ca kriyāsu anadhikāra uktaḥ (-)

ekatra siddhante dīkṣitasya anyatra nādhikāraḥ

ekatra dīkṣitastantre siddhante vā dvijottamaḥ |
kriyāṃ na kuryādanyatra karṣaṇādi (karpaṇādīṃścaturmukha ka kha ga 
ca) caturmukha ||

ācāryakamathārtvijyaṃ pūjādyaṃ madhuvidviṣaḥ |
tantrabhede ca siddhantabhede'pi ca (hi ga) na yujyate ||

ityuktvā punarapyuparyuparitantrasthitānām (tantrādhikārāṇāṃ ka kha ga ca 
jha) adho'dhastantrādhikāritvamuktam (adhikāritvaṃ pradarśitam ka kha ga 
ṅ ca ja jha)(-)

uparitanatantrādhikāriṇām adhastanatantreṣu tattanmārgeṇa karaṇe'dhikāraḥ

tantrāntare tathā tantra(-)mantra(mantre ja jha; mantrasiddhanta 
kha)siddhantavartmani (vartmanā ka jha) |
dīkṣitānāṃ krameṇaiva hyuparyupari yogadaḥ |
anyeṣāmadhikāraḥ syāt tattatsaṃskārapūrvakam ||

karaṇāgamasiddhantaniṣṭhenānyaistribhiḥ sadā |
arcanīyamathānyābhāṃ mantrasiddhantinā tathā ||

pūjanīyamathānyena tantrasiddhāntināniśam |
svena tantrāntareṇaiva pūjanīyaṃ svake gṛhe ||

iti | atrāpyutkṛṣṭasiddhāntasthitenāpi (api gha kośe nāsti) 
apakṛṣṭasiddhantasthāneṣu tattatsiddhantaprakāreṇaiva pūjanīyatvamuktam 
utkṛṣṭasiddhantasthitasya svasthāne'pakṛṣṭasiddhantaprasaṅgābhāvat | ata eva 
hyantaramevamucyate (anantaramevocyate ka kha ga jha)(-)

mukhyādhikāriṇaḥ santi yadi gauṇādhikāriṇaḥ |
svatantreṇa praveṣṭavyāḥ prāsāde ca svatantrake ||

iti | svatantreṇa svakīyena prāk pravṛttaśāstreṇetyarthaḥ | viśeṣataśca 
ekāyanavidhānasyānyatra praveśe pratyavāyātiśayaśca(cakāraḥ gha cha ja 
kośeṣu nāsti) tatraivoktaḥ(-) 

ekāyanavidhānasyānyatra praveśe pratyavāyah 

tatsiddhantānyamārgeṇa sthāpitaṃ bimbamālaye |
ajñānādathavā mohādekāyanavidhānataḥ |
arcayanāpadaṃ sarvāmāpnotīha paratra ca ||

iti | evamekaikasiddhantasthitānāṃ siddhāntāntarakriyāsu 
yathoktaprakriyayānadhikāre samarthite siddhantāntarapratiṣṭhiteṣu 
bhagavadāyaleṣu tadanyasiddhantasthitānāṃ 
pradakṣiṇapraṇāmamālākaraṇadīpāropaṇasaṃārjanasecanopalepanālaṃkaraṇarak
ṣaṇasaṃvardhanahavirādisamarpaṇastotrādīnāṃ sādhāraṇadharmāṇāmapi 
pratiṣedhaprasaṅgamāśaṅkya (pratiṣedhamāśaṅkya ka kha ga ca) 
parijahāra(-)

pradakṣiṇapraṇāmādi rādhānte'nyatra kevalam |
hivitaṃ nārcanaṃ kuryādrājarāṣṭabhayāvaham ||

iti |

(tatriva cha ja) tatrikonaviṃśe'dhyāye siddhantasaṃkare pratyavāyaṃ 
vistareṇa pratipādya 
asaṃkīrṇasiddhantadharmāṇāmevādhikāriṇāmanhonyasaṃbandhā(ādi gha 
kośe nāsti)diyogyatvam itareṣāṃ tu bāhyānamiva varjanīyatvamapi 
pratipāditam(-)

siddhāntānāṃ caturṇāṃ tu sāṃkarya vyasanāvaham |
siddhānteṣu caturṣvekaṃ pūrvairnṛbhiranuṣṭhitam ||

tyaktvā samāśrayedanyaṃ naro bhavati kilbiṣī |
tasmājjanmaprabhṛkarādhāntaniyato bhavet ||

anyathā kulamātmānaṃ sarvaṃ nāśayati svayam |
mantramaṇḍakuṇḍādikriyāmudropacārakaiḥ ||

yogaṃ nayati yo mohāt svasiddhantoktavartmani (vartmanā gha) |
so'pi svakulajān sarvān(dharmān ka kha jha) paramātmānamabjaja 
(param ātmānamiti padachedaḥ (ṭippaṇī) ||

nayennirayamatyugraṃ puruṣān puruṣādhamaḥ |
niṣphalā ca kriyā tasya pratyutānarthakāriṇī (kāraṇam gha ja) ||

akarmaṇo'sya tatkopo (kupyecca devastatkopo gha) rājarāṣṭrabhayāvahaḥ |
kartā kārayitā cobhau (caiva ka kha ga jha) sānvayaṃ vinaśiṣyataḥ ||

na saṃnidhānaṃ ca harerdhāmni hāniśca saṃpadām |
rādhāntasaṃkaraḥ kāryo nānyasiddhantakarmaṇā ||

mantrasiddhantamukhyeṣu caturṣvapi yathāpuram |
anutiṣṭhanti ye karma samārādhanamacyute |
asaṃkareṇa te'nyonyaṃ (saṃbaddha hi  ka kha ca ja jha) saṃbandhārhā 
narottamāḥ ||

iti | asaṃkareṇānutiṣṭhantītyanvaḥ |

siddhantasaṃkare doṣaprapañcanam

tatraiva jīrṇodhārādhyate(-) 

yā mūrtiyena tantreṇa yādṛśenādhikāriṇā |
prathame kalpane saiva dvitīye kalpane bhavet ||

mūrtistadeva tantraṃ ca sa eva sthāpakaḥ punaḥ |
tantrādhikārimūrtīnāṃ vyatyaye kalpite sati |
nṛṇāṃ narapateścāpi raṣṭrasya ca bhavet kṣayah ||

iti | tasminnevottaratra prāyaścittādyāye (-) 

janane maraṇe caiva śvasṛgālakharādibhiḥ |
spṛṣṭe ca bimbe tantrāṇāṃ saṃkare samupasthite |
evamādiṣu cānyeṣu saṃprokṣaṇavidhirbhavet || 

iti | narādīye'pi (-)

vyatyaye parivārāṇāṃ bhogādīnāṃ ca gautam |
pūrvavat snapanaṃ kṛtvā śāntihomaṃ smācaret ||

iti | atrādiśabdena siddhantavyatyayatantravyatyayādisaṃgraḥ 
apekṣitatvādaviśeṣācca | ata eva hyatraivoktam (-)

tantreṇaikena kartavyaṃ karṣaṇādiṣu nārada |
ystantreṇa samārabdhaṃ tattantraṇaiva kārayet ||

(anuktāśca ka kha ga) anuktāṃścānyatanteṣu nirīkṣyātra niyojayet 
(nirīkṣyānyatra yojayet ka kha ca jha) |
viśeṣāṃśca (viśeṣācca ka kha ṅ) muniśreṣṭha tvanyathā 
rāṣṭranāśakṛt ||

iti | pārameśvare ca pratiṣṭhādhyāye (-)

viśeṣeṇa svayaṃvyakte divye saiddhe'pi vārṣake (siddhe'pi cārṣake ka kha ga ca 
cha ja jha) |
sthāne tu karmabimbānāṃ vyatyayaṃ na samācaret |
dvārāṅgāvṛtidevānāṃ pūjāyā bhavanasya (havanasya gha ṅ) ca ||

ityārabhya

na lakṣaṇāntaraṃ kuryānna pramāṇāntaraṃ tathā |
na tu dravyāntaraṃ caiva na ca kuryāt kriyāntaram ||

mantrāntaraṃ (tantrāntaraṃ ka kha ga ṅ) na kurvīta sarvaṃ 
kuryādyathāpuram |
puryāccedevamādīnāṃ viparyāsaṃ mahāmate |
rājño rāṣṭrasya nāśaḥ syāt srvasyāpi svasaṃtateḥ ||

iti | tatraiva(-)

bhogānāṃ ca viparyāsaṃ mantrāṇāṃ ca viparyāyam (mahāmate gha cha 
ja) |
dyānānāṃ caiva mudrāṇāṃ devatānāṃ tathaiva ca |
anyeṣāmevamādīnāṃ (caivamādīnāṃ ka kha ga ca jha) vyatyāsaṃ na 
samācaret ||

iti | tathottaratra prāyaścittadyāye (-)

prāsādaśca tathā bimbo yena śāstreṇa nirmitau |
pratiṣṭhāpya ca tenaiva nityādau pūjayeddharim ||

yo'rcayedanyamārgeṇa tathā cārcāpakastu yaḥ |
tāvubhau kaluṣātmānau rājñao rāṣṭraṣya vai guroḥ ||

kulaṃ ca vyādhitaṃ caiva viplavaṃ duḥkhamañjasā |
vittahāniṃ viśeṣeṇa kuryātāmālayasya ca ||

(na kāryaṃ gha cha) na kuryāt tantrasāṃkaryaṃ pañcarātraparāyaṇaḥ 
(parāyaṇaiḥ gha cha) |
punaḥ pratiṣṭhā kartavyā kṛtaścet tantrasaṃkaraḥ ||

iti | tatraiva siddhantabhedaṃ (tatriva ca siddhantabhedān cha ja) vistareṇa 
pratipādyānantaramucyate(-)

śāstramantrakriyādīnāṃ mūrtīnāṃ bhavanasya ca |
deśikasyābhijātasya yathāpūrvaṃ parigrahaḥ ||

tathaiva yāvatkālaṃ tu nācartavyaṃ tadanyathā |
viparīte te kṛte cātra rājarāṣṭrādyanarthakṛt ||

tataḥ samācaredyatnāt pratiṣṭhāṃ prākprakārataḥ |
tataḥ siddhantasāṃkaryaṃ nācartavyaṃ kṛtātmabhiḥ ||

yadyadiṣṭatamaṃ loke pūrvasiddhavirodhi tat |
pratigrāhyamathānyonyaṃ viruddhaṃ saṃtyajedbudhaḥ ||

iti | evaṃ kālottare caturvidhapūjānirṇayādhyāye(-)

vaidikaistāntrikairvāpi śrotairvāpi dvijottama (śrautairvā dvijasattamaḥ 
ja) |
svayaṃvyakte tu bhavane miśrairvā devamarcayet ||

ṛṣyādipūjite sthāne pāraṃparyakramaṃ vinā |
viśeṣaṃ nācaret kiṃcidrājarāṣṭrasamṛddhaye ||

iti | asminnevottaratra prāyaścittadhyāye'pyetāveva ślokau paṭhitau | tatraiva(-)

yadvimbaṃ yena śāstreṇa samārabdhaṃ purā dvija |
prāsado(prāsādaṃ ca cha ja) vā tatastena śāstreṇaiva samarcayet 
(tadarcayet gha cha ja) ||

tacchāstramantareṇaiva yo yajedanyavartmanā |
rājño rāṣtrasya kartuśca (vināśaṃ) sa nāśaṃ kartumicchati ||

na kadācidapi prājñaḥ prakuryācchāstrasaṃkaram |
śāstrasaṃkaradoṣeṇa mahān doṣo bhaveddhuvam ||

iti | yadyapi vaikhānasapañcarātrasaṃkaraparihārasyapyatraiva śāstre pratipādanāt 
tatparihārārthamidaṃ vacanamiti vaktuṃ śakyam tathāpi yena śāstreṇa iti 
sāmānya vacanāt sarvaviṣayameva | yat tatroktam (-)

mahotsaveṣu sarveṣu deśakālānusāratah (deśikendrānusārataḥ ka kha ga ca 
cha ja jha) |
viśeṣaṃ nācaret kiṃcidrājarāṣṭrasamṛddhaye ||

iti nigamyate (cocyate ka kha ga ṅ jha) |

evaṃ pañcarātrākhaikaśāstrāvāntarasaṃkarasyātyantagarhitatve 
vaikhānasapañcarātrasamkaraḥ kaimutyaniṣiddhaḥ (kaimutikanyayasiddhaḥ ka 
kha ga śa jha) | parasparaṃ ca dvayorapi spaṣṭaṃ pratiṣidhyate | pañcarātrasya 
tu vaikhānasairapi dvacit dvacidupajīvyatvamasti | tathāhi (-)

vaikhānasena pāñcarātrasya saṃkare doṣaḥ | pāñcarātraṃ tu sarvopajīvyam

brāhmaṇe kṣatriyairvaiśyaiḥ śūdraiśca kṛtalakṣaṇaiḥ |
arcanīyaśca sevyaśca nityayuktaiḥ svarkarmasu |
sātvātaṃ vidhimāsthāya gītaḥ saṃkarṣaṇena yaḥ ||

ityādibhiraviśeṣeṇa brāhmāṇādīnāṃ (śrīmatpañcarātra gha cha ja) 
śrīpāñcarātroktamārgeṇa bhagavadarcanādikaṃ kartavyamiti 
mahābhāratādiṣvabhidhīyate | na hi dvacidapi sūtraviśeṣādiniyamaḥ kṛtaḥ | 
pratyuta (sarva ka kha ga kośeṣu nāsti) sarvasūtraniṣṭhānāṃ 
tadanvayastasminneva śāstre pratipādyate (-)

niṣekādīṃśca saṃskārān svasūtroktāna samācaret |
pañcarātroditān vāpi ye svayaṃśyairanuṣṭhitāḥ ||

iti | na ca bodhāyanavikhanaḥśaunakādyukteṣu bhagavatpratiṣṭhārcanādiṣu satsu 
kimanyeneti vācyam taduktirahitasūtraniṣṭhānāmanyāpekṣayāṃ 
sādhāraṇaśāstraparigrahopapatteḥ | (na kvacit pūrṇopadeśaḥ sambhavatīti 
tacchaktasya pūrṇopādānaṃ ka kha ga ṅ ca jha) na ca dvacit pūrṇopadeśe 
saṃbhavati tacchaktasyāpūrṇamupādātuṃ yuktam | ata eva hautraṃ 
hotṛśākhoktamadhvaryavo'pi parigṛhṇanti | ato yeṣu sūtreṣu 
bhagavadarcanādikaṃ pratyapādi tanniṣṭhānāmapi bhagavacchāstroktaprakriyayā 
samārādhanādikaṃ praśastatamam | tathā ca śiṣṭairanuṣṭhīyate |

nanu ca vaikhānasasūtrānusāriṣu (kāśyapīya gha ja) 
kāśyapamarīcibhārvagātreyeṣu śāstreṣu tadanubandhiṣu cādhikāragrantheṣu 
saṃgrahavistarūpeṣu bhagavatpratiṣṭhārcanādikaṃ pūrṇamupadiśatsu kiṃ 
pañcarātreṇa(?) maivam tatsūtraniṣṭhān pratyeva tatprakriyopadeśāt | tarhi 
tanniṣṭhānāṃ pañcarātraprakriyāyā anupādeyatve tasyāḥ 
sarvasūtraniṣṭhasādhāraṇyaṃ bhajyeteti cet tanna uktottaratvāt (dattottaratvāt 
ka śa ca ja jha) | kāśyapīyādīnyapi hi (hi ka kha gha ca jha kośeṣu 
nāsti) śāstrāṇi kāṃcit prakriyāmupadiśanti teṣu teṣvartheṣu 
śāstrāntaropajīvīnyeva evaṃ pañcarātroktamapi kvacit dvacidupajīvanti | yathoktaṃ 
bṛguproktakriyādhikāre(-) 

gurūpadeśasaṃsiddyaiḥ kalpamantrairathāpi vā |
āsanādyupacāraiṣtu pūjayediti kecana ||

iti | atra kalpamantraśabdena bhagavacchāstroktamantrāṇāmeva grahaṇam | ata eva 
hi athītavedān vaikhānasān prati gurūpadeśasaṃsiddhaiḥ iti viśeṣyate | na ca 
tattanmantrakalpāḥ pañcarātratantrebhyaḥ pṛthagbhūtāḥ | caturdhā vyūdhe hi 
tasmin śāstre pratyekaṃ ca saṃhitābhedabhedini sarve'pi 
bhagavanmantrakalpāstadaṅgamantrakalpāśca yathāyathaṃ samāviśanti | ata eva 
hi tāṃstān bhagavanmantrakalpān ārṣapañcarātramityabhiyuktā vyavaharanti 
(varṇayanti ka kha ga a ja jha) | tanniṣṭhāṃśca kalpabhāgavataśabdena 
vyapadiśanti | evaṃ bhārgavādiṣvapi 

vaikhānasena sūtreṇa niṣekādikriyānvitān |
viprān vedavidaḥ śuddhān mantrakalpavicakṣaṇān ||

ityādiṣu mantrakalpavedanoktistatra tatrāpekṣitagrahaṇārthā | tathā bhārgave 
kriyādhikāre sārasvatapratiṣṭhādikaṃ prakramyocyate(-) anena vidhinā sthāpya 
kalpamantreṇa pūjayet iti | na cātra kalpamantrasvarūpatadaṅgādikamupadiṣṭam | 
ataḥ kalpoktaprakriyaivātrānusaraṇīyā | evaṃ tatra sudarśanarūpasya bhagavataḥ 
pratiṣṭhārcanādau parkrānte phalabhedāpekṣayā prakriyāntaramupakṣipyate (-)

etadvaidikamuddiṣṭaṃ bhuktimuktiphalapradam |
devalaṃ bhuktikamāścet smarenmantraṃ ṣaḍakṣaram ||

iti | na cātra ṣaḍakṣaramantraprakriyāyāḥ prapañcanam | tataśca 
vāsiṣṭhagārgyavihagendrāhirbudhnyādisaṃhitoktaprakriyaiva śaraṇam | evaṃ 
dvibhujaprabhṛtiṣoḍaśabhujaparyantarūpopadeśe'pi anuktamapya(api gha 
kośe nāsti)pekṣitamanyato grāhyam | ata eva hi kṛṣṇarūpāṇyanantāni 
ityādibhiḥ kṛṣṇanarasiṃhādirūpāṇāmasaṃkhyeyatvena vaktumaśakyatayā 
viramyate | teṣu ca (deṣucit ka kha ga) kāninicchāstrāntaroktāni 
saṃgrāhyāṇyeva | ata idaṃ vedānteṣu yathāsāraṃ saṃgṛhya bhagavān hariḥ 
ityuktaprakriyayā sarvavedāntasāroddhāreṇa sarvajanahitaiṣiṇa | bhagavatā 
svayameva praṇītaṃ śrīmatyañcarātraśāstraṃ sarvasūtraniṣṭhānāmupajīvyamiti 
siddham |

yattu śrīvaikhānase (-)

vakhānasapāñcharātrayoḥ parasparanindāvacanānāṃ prakṣiptatvapakṣaḥ

āgneyaṃ pañcarātraṃ tu dīkṣāyuktaṃ ca tāntrikam |
avaidikatvāt tattantraṃ tyaktvā vaikhānasena tu |
saumyena vaidikenaiva devadevaṃ samarcayet ||

ityādi yaccoktaṃ śrīpāñcarātre tantrasārasamuccaye(-) aśrīkaramasaumyaṃ ca 
vaikhānasamasāttvikam (atāttvikam ka kha ga jha) ityārabhya tadvidhānaṃ 
parityajya pañcarātreṇa pūjayet ityādi yāni ca 
pādmapārameśvarādiṣvativādavacanāni tāni nūnam ikṣubhakṣaṇacikīrṣubhiḥ 
(ikṣubhakṣakartṛcikīrṣubhiḥ ka kha ga gha) prakṣiptāni 
parasparasthānākramaṇalolupairvaṭubhirvā (paṭubhirvā ja) 
pūjakādhamairniveśitāni |

avirodhopayogābhyāmubhayorapi śāstrayoḥ |
madhyasthairhi kṛtaṃ dharmavidyāsthānaniveśanam (niveśanam | iti ka kha 
ga ca) ||

anyathā parsiddhaprāmāṇyoḥ (prasiddhaprāmāṇyayoḥ kha ga kośayoḥ 
nāsti) parigrahaprācuryavatoḥ prasiddhatareṣu 
śrīraṅgaśrīmadveṅkaṭādriśrīhastiśailavṛṣabhagiriprabhṛtiṣu 
pāraṃparyeṇa pravṛttayoḥ 
vāsādinibaddhaśrīvaiṣṇavadharmaśāstrakāṇḍādiṣu 
(dharmaśāstrakarmakāṇḍādiṣu ja)

bhagavānuvāca(-)

śṛṇu pāṇḍava tatsarvamarcanākramamātmanaḥ |
sthaṇḍile padmakaṃ kṛtvā cāṣṭapatraṃ sakarṇikam ||

aṣṭākṣaravidhānenāipathavā dvādaśākṣaraiḥ |
vaidikairathavā mantrairmama sūktena vā punaḥ ||

sthāpitaṃ māṃ tatastasminnarcayitvā vicakṣaṇaḥ |
puruṣaṃ tu tataḥ satyamacyutaṃ ca yudhiṣṭhira ||

aniruddhaṃ ca māṃ prāhurvaikhānasavido janāḥ |
anye tvaivaṃ vijānanti māṃ rājan pāñcarātrikāḥ ||

vāsudevaṃ ca rājendra saṃkarṣaṇamathāpi vā |
pradyumnaṃ cāniruddhaṃ ca caturmūrtiṃ pracakṣate ||

etā anyāśca rājendra saṃjñābhedena mūrtayaḥ |
viddhyanarthāntarā eva māmevaṃ cārcayedbudhaḥ ||

ityādibhiḥ vaiṣṇaivaśāstrabhedatvena samapripaṭhitayorvedāviruddhayoḥ 
bhagavadyāmunamunivāsudevasvāmiprabhṛtibhiḥ 
sthāpitaprāmāṇyayoraviśeṣavaiṣṇavasamayaparigrayoḥ (śrīpañcarātra ka 
ca) śrīmatpañcarātravaikhānasaśāstrayoḥ dvayorapyaprāmāṇyaprasaṅgāt |

prasparanindāvacanāni svaśāstrapraśaṃsāparāṇi

athaitāni parasparāpakarṣavacanāni 
asaṃkīrṇabahukośapāṭhāvalokanādāptabhāṣitānīti manyehahi tathāpi prātaḥ 
prātaranṛtaṃ te vadanti purodayājjuhvati ye'gnihotraṃ ityādiṣu 
uditahomapra(praśaṃsārtham ka ca)śaṃsārthānuditahomanindāvat 
(nindādivat ka ca) 
prakrāntaśāstraprāśastyapratipādanaparatvena(prāśastyamātraparatvena gha 
cha ja) netavyāni | na hi nindā nindyaṃ nindituṃ pravartate api tu nindyāditarat 
praśaṃsitum iti nyāyavidaḥ |

evameva sāṅgeṣu vedeṣu niṣṭhāmalabhamānaḥ śāṇḍilyaḥ 
pañcarātraśāstramadhītavān ityādau vedanindāprasaṅgena 
vedavirodhamāśaṅvaya svaśāstrapraśaṃsādiparatvena paryahāri bhāṣyakāraiḥ 
nyadarśi ca ṛgvedaṃ bhagavo'dhyemi ityāramhya sa'hoṃ bhagavo 
mantravidevāsmi nātmavit iti bhūmavidyopakramagatasya 
taditarasamastavedādhyayanādātmavedanālābhavacanasya 
bhūmavidyāpraśaṃsāmātre tātparyam | api ca(-) 

catvāra ekato vedā bhārataṃ caikamekataḥ |
samāgataiḥ surarṣibhistulāmāropitaṃ purā ||

mahattve ca gurutve ca dhriyāmāṇe tato'dhikam (yato'dhikam gha ṅ cha ja) 
|
mahattvācca gurutvācca mahābāratamīritam (ucyate gha) ||

ityādivacanāni vedebhyo'pi mahābhāratasyādhikaṃ bruvāṇāni 
vedhārthopabṛṃhaṇarūpātiśayaśālimahābhāratapraśaṃsārthāniḥ na 
punarvedānāmapakarṣagandhamabhidadhate | kiṃca bahvṛcāmnāye ṛgyāthā 
kumbyā tanmitaṃ yajurnigado vṛthā vāktadamitaṃ sāmādho yaḥ kaśca geṣṇaḥ 
iti yajurādinindā ṛgvedastutyarthaiva | evamihāpi śrīvaikhānasapañcarātrayoḥ 
parasparāpakarṣavacanānāmāptatve'pi svābhimatastulyarthatayaiva nirvodhvym 
anyathā sarvopaplavaprasaṅgāt avisragbhaṇīyavacanānāṃ 
yathāśrutasvīkāre'tiprasaṅgācca |

evameva (evamiva ṅ cha) hi śaivāgame kāraṇatantre jalpyate 
(kathyte ka kha ga ca) (-)

śaivagamakāraṇatantra vacanānāmapi svaśāstrapraśaṃsāparatvam

śaivaḥ sarvādhikārī syāt svakīye ca paratra ca |
śaivāḥ sarvaṃ prakurvanti ye gṛhasthā dvijottamāḥ ||

yāmale mātṛnamantre ca kāpāle pañcarātrake |
bauddhe vāpyārhate caiva lāguḍe vaidike'pi ca ||

anyeṣvapi ca mārgeṣu tattacchāstrānusārataḥ |
śaivāḥ sarvaṃ prakurvanti talliṅgasthāpanādikam ||

mukhyatvādiha śaivasya mukhyamāhātmyato'pi ca |
adhikāro'sti sarvatra nānyeṣāṃ śivadarśane ||

iti | nanu pāśupatādhikaraṇe patyurasāmañjasyāt iti paśupatiparaṇītānāṃ 
śaivādīnāṃ sarveṣāṃ tantrāṇāmaprāmāṇyasamarthanāt etasminnapi vacane 
(jainālayaṃ ka kha ga ca) jinālayaṃ praviṣṭasu savāsā jayamāviśet 
ityādibhirdarśanasparśanādyayogyaviṣaya(viṣayaṃ ka kha ga kośeṣu 
nāsti)jainayāmalabauddhadibāhyamatatantraiḥ (bauddhabāhyāditantraiḥ ka 
kha ga ca) saha vaidikasya samabhivyāhārāt vaidikānarheṣu bāhyeṣu ca 
śaivasyādhikārokteḥ 

śaivān pāśupatān spṛṭvā yokāyatikanāstikān |
vikarmasthān dvijān śūdrān savāsā jayamāviśet ||

iti vijñāneśvarasaṃgṛhītadharmaśāstravacanena sparśādiṣu pariharaṇīyatvena 
prasiddhasya śaivasya vaidikadevatāpratiṣṭhādiṣu mukhyādhikāritvajalpanāt 
(kalpanāt ka kha ga ca) loke ca śaiveḥ kvacidapi (śaive kadācidapi ka 
kha ga jha) bhagavatpratiṣṭhādyanumatyabhāvāt tatsparśādiṣvapi 

sthāpite pañcarātreṇa deve (devaiḥ ka kha ga ca ja jha) ṣaḍbhiḥ 
śivādhvabhiḥ (śivādibhiḥ ka ca; śivārthibhiḥ kha ga jha) |
pratiṣṭhādau kṛte mohād doṣaḥ sarvakṣayātmakaḥ ||

śāntiśca tasya bhūyo'pi pañcarātroktavartmanā |
pratiṣṭhāpya sahasreṇa kalaśaiḥ snāpanaṃ hareḥ |
mahotsavaśca kartavyo dhvajārohaṇapūrvakam ||

iti pādmādipratipāditaprāyaścittaviśeṣānuṣṭhānadarśanācca 
śaivastutivacanasyāsya

tvaṃ hi rudra mahābāho mohaśāstrāṇi kāraya |
darśayitvālpamāyāsaṃ phaḷaṃ śīghraṃ pradarśaya ||

ityādiprakāreṇāprāmāṇyamanīśvaraprakṣiptatvamativādarūpatayā 
svīyatantrādhikāriśaivastutimātrarūpatvaṃ vā kalpanīyamiti cet hanta tarhi 
anayorapi śrivaiṣṇavamārgabhedayoranyatarasyetaratra (itaratantrapraviṣṭaiḥ ka 
ca jha; itaratantraviśiṣṭaiḥ cha ja) śiṣṭairapraveśanāt 
parasparasaṃkaraprasaṅge ca tattattantroktaprāyaścittanuṣṭhānadarśanācca 
parasparāpakarṣaparasparamaryādāpraveśanavacanāni prakṣiptatvādapramāṇāni 
ativādarūpatayā svatantrastutiparāṇīti vā (vā ka kha ga jha kośeṣu nāsti) 
nirvāhyatvāt paraṃparāgatamaryādāparityāgena 
(prasparapraveśo'narthamartha iti gha) parasparapraveśo na kṣama iti 
madhyasthadṛṣṭyā saṃpaśyadhvam | tatra pakṣe patantastu patantyeva 
paramadharmamaryādopaplavāt | ato vaikhānasapañcarātrayoḥ 
pañcarātrāvāntarabhedacatuṣkasya tattadavāntaratantrabhedānāṃ ca 
parasparamasaṃkareṇaiva sarvadā sthitiriti siddham |

apakṛṣṭasiddhantatyāgenāpi utkṛṣṭasiddhantapraveśakavacanānāṃ 
prakṣiptatvapakṣaḥ

tatredaṃ tu kiṃcidvimarśanīyam | yat (yattat ka kha ga) 
pārameśvarakalottarayoḥ pramāṇabhūtānāmeva (bhagavaccāstra ka kha ga 
kośeṣu nāsti) bhagavaccāstrasiddhantānāmākārāntareṇotkarṣāpakarṣayogāt 
prākpravṛttapakṛṣṭasiddhāntaparityāgenāpi utkṛṣṭasiddhāntapraveśanaṃ 
na doṣāya pratyuta guṇāyaiva utkṛṣṭatantraparityāgena nikṛṣṭatantrapraveśane 
samānatantrasaṃkare ca doṣa ityuktam(-) idamapi dattottaraprāyam | tathāhi(-)

śrīsāttvate dvāviṃśe paricchede (samādhiputrakasādhaka gha; 
samayaputrivāsādhan ga; samayaputrakasādhaka ka kha ca jha) 
samayipatrakasādhakalakṣaṇoktyanantaram ācāryalakṣaṇe sāṃkaryamāgamānāṃ 
ca vetti vākyavaśāttu yaḥ ityuktvā 
śāstrasaṃkaraśodhanārthamanantaramucyate(-)

tatra vai trividhaṃ vākyaṃ divyaṃ ca munibhāṣitam |
pauruṣaṃ cāravindākṣa tadbhedamavadhāraya ||

yadarthādhyasaṃdigdhaṃ (svalpaṃ ka kha ga) svacchamalpākṣaraṃ 
sthiram (smṛtam ka ca; sthitam kha ga) |
tat pārameśvaraṃ vākyamājñāsiddhaṃ hi mokṣadam ||

praśaṃsakaṃ vai siddhīnāṃ saṃpravartakamaṣyatha |
sarveṣāṃ rañjakaṃ (gūḍhaṃ ka kha ga gha ṅ ca cha jha) 
gūḍhaniścayīkaraṇakṣaram ||

munivākyaṃ ca tadviddhi caturvargaphalapradam |
anarthakamasaṃbaddhamalpārthaṃ śabdaḍambaram ||

anirvāhakamādyoktervākyaṃ tat pauruṣaṃ smṛtam |
heyaṃ cānarthasiddhināmākaraṃ narakāvaham ||

prasiddhārthānuvādaṃ yat saṃgatārthaṃ vilakṣaṇaṃ |
api cet pauruṣaṃ vākyaṃ grāhyaṃ tanmunivākyavat ||

iti | atra anirvāhakamādyokteḥ iti divyamunibhāṣitayoḥ viruddhārthatvamucyate | 
asaṃbaddhamiti pūrvaparaviruddhatvam | tadidamubhayamapi 
nidṛṣṭasaṃhitatyātena utkṛṣṭasaṃhitāparigrahavacane 
śrīsāttvatapauṣkaranāradīyapādmādivirodhāt sāmānynena 
sarvasaṃkaraniṣedhaparasvapūrvāparagraṇthavirodhamavadhārayanto 
dhṛṣṭabuddhayaḥ katicana 
tantratantrāntaramaryādāpravṛttasthānākramaṇalubdhāgamamantrasiddhantabhim
ānipuruṣakṛtaprakṣepo'yamiti manyante |

utkṛṣṭaiddhantasvīkāravacanānāṃ mantrasiddhantastutiparatvapakṣaḥ 

anye tu prāguktanyāyena mantrasiddhantādistutiparatāmātiṣṭhante | na khalvetāvatā 
kālena kalpārambhakṛtayugāt prabhṛti saṃtanyamāneṣu 
sāttvataśāstrasaṃhitāsrotobhedeṣu apakṛṣṭasaṃhitāṃ 
parityajyotkṛṣṭasaṃhitāṃ kaścit parijagrāheti mahābhārate 
śrīmadvarāhapurāṇādiṣu vā paraḥśateṣu pañcarātraprastāveṣu maharṣayaḥ 
sūcayanti | na cārvācīnairapyārcāyairitaḥ pūrvaṃ tathā kṛtamiti 
saṃpradāyavidaḥ śiṣṭā vidāmāsuḥ | ataḥ śiṣṭānuṣṭhānabalādeva 
stutiparatvamadhyavasyāmaḥ | yadi caivaṃ śāstrārthaḥ syāt etāvatā kālena 
tantratantrāntarasthānāni sarvāṇi mantrasiddhantādinā vyāpyaran | itaḥ 
pūrvamanuvṛtāvapi parastādetadbalāvayambanena tantratantrāntarasiddhantayoḥ 
sarvatrocchedaḥ prasajyet | atha cedaihikabhogādiprācuryat puruṣāṇāṃ ca 
trivargaprāvaṇyatiśayāt tantratantrāntarayoḥ sarvatrānuvṛttiḥ saṃbhavatīti 
manvīthāḥ tarhi (rāj gha kośe nasti) rājaraṣṭrasamṛddhyartheṣu 
sthāneṣvaihikaphalapracurayoreva tantratantrāntarayorthāpūrvamavasthānamucitam | 
na hi rājasu rāṣṭreṣu vā sulabhāḥ kevalamumukṣavaḥ |

tantrāntarasiddhantasya śrīkaratvaṃ mokṣapradatvaṃ ca

śrīkarasaṃhitāyāṃ ca prāguktasyaiva siddhantacatuṣṭayasya vedasiddhanto 
divyasiddhantastantrasiddhantaḥ purāṇasiddhanta iti 
prāguktādūraviprakṛṣṭairnāmabhedairvibhāgamuktvā 
purāṇasiddhantasaṃjñitasya tantrātantrasiddhantasya mokṣapradasyāpi viśeṣataḥ 
śrīkaratvamuktam(-)

etat purāṇasiddhantaṃ śrīkaraṃ ca viśeṣataḥ |
idaṃ śrīkarasaṃjñākhyaṃ bhogamokṣaphalapradam ||

iti | asya ca pūrvāparaṃ sarvaṃ sanmārgadīpikāyāṃ vistareṇaṃ draṣṭavyam | 
bhogamokṣaphalapradamityasya śrīkarasaṃjñakasaṃhitāviśeṣānvitatve'pi tasyāḥ 
saṃhitāyāḥ purāṇasiddhantāntaḥpātitvāt viśeṣata iti (viśeṣa iti ka kha ga 
ca) niyamāt cakāreṇānuktasamuccayācca kṛtsnasyāpi tantrāntarasiddhantasya 
viśeṣataḥ śrīkaratvaṃ mokṣapradatvaṃ ca siddham | śrīkāmāśca prāyaśo hi 
rājāno rāṣṭravartinaśceti tatsamṛddhyartheṣu sādhāraṇasthaneṣu 
tantrāntarasiddhantasyaucityamadhikam | niḥsaṅgāstu svagṛhādiṣu 
āgamasiddhantādimaryādāmanutiṣṭhantu nām | astantratantrāntarasthāneṣu 
anyasiddhantāvataraṇavacanamapavargapratyāsattyatiśayanibandhanaprāśastyādhiv
ayaparamiti mantavyam | tadapekṣayaivedamuktaṃ kālottare svayaṃ vyaktaṃ tathā 
divyamutkṛṭaphaladaṃ yataḥ iti |

utkṛṣṭasiddhantasvīkāravacanānāṃ svayaṃvyaktasthānaiṣayatvapakṣaḥ 

apare tvāhuḥ vyavasthitasthānaviṣayamevedam (evedaṃ ka kha ga ca cha ja jha 
kośeṣu nāsti) apakṛṣṭasaṃhitātyāgenotkṛṣṭasaṃhitāparigravacanamiti | 
tathāhi yaduktaṃ kālottare (-)

anekabhedabhinnaṃ ca pañcarātrākhyamāgamam |
pūrvamāgamasiddhantaṃ mantrākhyaṃ tadanantaram |
tantraṃ tantrāntaraṃ ceti caturdhā parikīrtitam ||

iti caturdhā vibāgaṃ sāmānyena pratipādya (nārāyaṇīyaṃ maudadhyamāgni 
gha; nārāyaṇīyamaudgalyam ka kha ga jha) 
nārāyaṇīyamaudadhyamagnikāśyapasaṃjñitam ityādinā śāstrāṇyetāni survata 
ityantenāgamādisīdhānteṣu caturṣu katipayasaṃhitānāṃ (nidarśanaṃ ka kha g 
ca) niveśanamanuktānāmapi saṃhitānāmupalakṣaṇatayodāhṛtya etadvai 
pañcarātrākhyaṃ śāstraṃ sarvottamottamam iti caturvidhamapi 
pañcarātraśāstraṃ sarvottamatvena nigamya

āgamādisiddhantānāṃ svayaṃvyaktādināmnāpi nirdeśaḥ 

caturdhā bhedabhinnaṃ ca svayaṃvyaktādibhedataḥ |
svayaṃvyaktaṃ hi siddhantamāgamākhyaṃ poroditam ||

mantrasiddhantasaṃjñaṃ yat tad divyaṃ parikīrtitam |
tantrasaṃjñaṃ hi yacchastraṃ tat saiddhaṃ samudāhṛtam |
tantrāntaraṃ tu yat proktamārṣaṃ tat samudāhṛtam ||

iti praguktānāmevāgamasiddhantādīnāṃ (prāguktānāmeva siddhantānāṃ ka; 
prāguktānāmeva siddhantādīnāṃ kha ga) svayaṃvyaktadivyasaiddharṣarūpeṇa 
vakṣyamāṇopayogisaṃjñāntarāṇi nirdiśya

svayaṃvyaktena divyena pūjyamāne tu kautuke (kautukāt ka jha; 
svayaṃvyaktena ityārabhya sārdhaślokadvayaṃ kha ga pustakayoḥ na 
dṛśyate) |
tantratantrāntarābhyāṃ tu na kuryād devapūjanam ||

pūjyate yadi saṃohāt sthānanāśo bhaved dhruvam |
rājño rāṣṭrasya kartuśca maraṇaṃ jāyate dhruvam ||

tasmāt pūjā na kartavyā tantratantrāntarādhvanā |
(svayaṃvyakte ca divye ca saiddhe cārṣe dvijotama ka kha ga) anuktaṃ yat 
svayaṃvyakte divye śāstre dvijottama ||

yat kiṃcit tattadādeyaṃ tantratantrāntare yathā (tathā ka kha ga ṅ jha) |
tantratantrāntaroktena pūjyamāne'pi deśikaiḥ ||

tadvivānaṃ parityajya svayaṃvyaktoktavartmanā |
divyoktavidhinā kāryaṃ pūjanaṃ pratimāsu ca (pratimāsu ceti ka kha ga ca 
jha) ||

svayaṃvyaktaṃ tathā divyamutkṛṣṭaphaladaṃ yataḥ |
tasmādurkṛṣṭaśāstroktamārgeṇa supūjayet ||

iti tantratantrāntarābhyāṃ pujjyamāne'pi tadvidhānaṃ parityajya 
utkṛṣṭaphaladatvena utkṛṣṭena svayaṃvyaktena divyena ca śāstreṇa pūjanaṃ 
yuktamiti |

utkṛṣṭasiddhantasvīkāravacanānāṃ svayaṃvyaktasthānaviṣayatvam

tadidaṃ sarvasthānaviṣayaṃ pratiniyatasthānaviṣayaṃ veti vicāraṇīyam | yadi 
(sarvaviṣayaṃ ṅ cha ja) sarvasthānaviṣayaṃ tadā 
parigṛhītatamasāttvatādyanekasaṃhitāgranthasaṃkocaḥ prasajyet | apica 
asminnevottaratra svayaṃvyaktādisthānalakṣaṇanirūpaṇādhyāye 
tattatsthānalakṣaṇamuktvā paścāt caturvidhapūjānirṇayādhyāye 
caturvidhapūjanasya yathākramaṃ vaidikaṃ tāntrikaṃ śrautaṃ miśraṃ ceti 
caturvidham iti prakamya 
mūlaśrutidivyamantrapravṛttaśrutitatsaṃbhedanimittanāmadheyāni 
pratipādhyānantaramucyate (-)

vaidikaistāntrikairvāpi śrautairvā dijasattama |
svayaṃvyakte tu bhavane miśrairvā devamarcayet ||

ṛṣyādipūjite sthāne pāraṃparyakramaṃ vinā |
viśeṣaṃ nācaret kiṃcidrājarāṣṭrasamṛddhaye ||

iti | atra svayaṃvyaktasthāne carurṇāṃ pūjāviśeṣāṇāṃ yathāruci vikalpena 
parigrahaṃ pratipādyaṃ ṛṣyādipūjiteṣu sthānāntareṣu 
pāraṃparyakramamantareṇa mātrayāpi viśeṣaṃ nācaredityuktatvāt yatra 
(yatra ka kha ga kośeṣu nāsti) svayaṃvyakte vikalpena karmaṇāṃ 
pravṛttiḥ saṃbhavati (saṃbhavatīti ka ga) 
tatraivāpakṛṣṭaphalaśāstraparityāgena utkṛṣṭaphalaśastraparigrahavacanaṃ 
liṅgavaśānnetavyam | pavitraṃ dakṣiṇe karṇe iti liṅgāt divā saṃdhyāsu 
karṇasthabrahmasūtraḥ ityasya sthānaniyamavat pratiniyatasvayaṃvyakteṣu 
sthāneṣviti vyaktamavasīyate | asminnevottaratra prāyaścittadhyāye'pi 
vaidikaistāntrikarvāpi ityādi ślokadvayaṃ punaḥ paṭhitam | mānuṣe bhavane 
devaṃ tantramārgeṇa pūjayet iti coktam | punaśca (-) 

yadbimbaṃ yena śāstreṇa samārabdhaṃ purā dvija |
prāsādo vā tatastena śāstraiṇaiva tadarcayet ||

tacchāstramantareṇaiva yo yajedanyavartmanā |
rājño rāṣṭrasya kartuśca sa nāśaṃ kartumicchati ||

na kadācidapi prājñaḥ prakuryācchāstrasaṃkaram |
śāstrasaṃkaradoṣeṇa mahān doṣo bhaved dhruvam || 

ityuktam | ato'pyatrāpakṛṣṭaśāstraparityāgenotkṛṣṭaśāstraparigrahavacanaṃ 
svenaiva nānāśāstrārthavikalpayogyatvena pratipādite svayaṃvyakte sthāne 
sthāpanīyamiti siddham |

sthānaviśeṣamadhikṛtya śāstrādhikāriṇoḥ niyamaparāṇāṃ 
vacanānāmarthavicāraḥ 

yadapi cātra sthānaviśeṣamadhikṛtya (śāstrādhikāriṇaḥ ka kha ga ca) 
śāstrādhikāriṇorniyamaḥ kriyate(-)

svayaṃvyakte tathā divye divyaśāstroktavartmanā |
mūlāgamasametena mukhairbhāgavataiḥ sadā ||

pūjanaṃ prayataiḥ kāryaṃ pañcakālaparāyaṇaiḥ |
vaiṣṇavāyatane kāryaṃ kevalaiḥ pāñcarātrikaiḥ ||

sāṃtānikaiḥ praviṣṭairvā munivākyoktarvartmanā |
anuktānyarthajālāni siddhanteṣvāgamādiṣu |
anyonyāpekṣayā grāhyaṃ śāstroṣvanyanna cāharet ||

iti etadapi prakṛṣṭasthāne prakṛṣṭādhikāriṇāṃ 
(prakṛṣṭaśāstraparigraha ka kha ga ca jha) 
prakṛṣṭaśāstrādiparigrahaucityamapakṛṣṭasthāne'pakṛṣṭādhikāriṇāmapak
ṛṣṭaśāstrādiyogyatvaṃ ca sthāpayati anyathā vaiṣṇavāyatane kvacidapi 
divyaśāstrānavatāraprasaṅgāt mānuṣe'pi bhavane mukhyādhikāribhiḥ pratiṣṭhite 
divyaśāstreṇa pūjanādikartavyatvasya pārameśvaranirūpaṇe 
darśaviṣyamāṇatvācca | atrāpi siddhantasaṃkaraparihāra eva anuktānyarthajālāni 
ityādinā sthāpitaḥ |

yat punaḥ pārameśvare svayaṃvyaktanirṇayādhyāye (-)

divyaśāstreṇa pūjanasya sarvatra saṃbhavaḥ

svayaṃvyaktaṃ tathā siddhaṃ vibudhaiśca (siddhavibudhaiśca ka kha ga 
ca) pratiṣṭhitam |
munimukhaiśca (mukhaistu kha ca cha ja jha) 
gandharvaikṣairvidyādharairapi ||

rakṣobhiradhamairmukhaiḥ sthāpitaṃ mantravigraham |
divyaśāstroktavidhinā pūjayecchāstrakovidaḥ ||

iti idamapi divyaśāstrasya sarvasthāneṣu saṃbhavaṃ (samabhāvaṃ kha ga; 
sadbhāvaṃ gha ṅ ca cha ja) darśayati na tu śāstrāntaraparityāgena 
divyapraveśam |

(yattvanantara ka kha ga ca) yaccanantaramuktam (-)

sthāpitaṃ manujairdevaṃ munivākyena yatra tu |
pūjayed dvija tatrāpi jñānibhistattvadarśibhiḥ |
vāsudevaikaniṣṭhaistu devatāntaravarjitaiḥ ||

iti idaṃ ca vyāmiśramunivākyasthāpite'pi (api ka kha ga ṅ ca kośeṣu 
nāsti) sthāne vyāmiśrayāgamuktairvāsudervaikaniṣṭhaiḥ pūjanamātraṃ 
praśastamityāha na punarmanuvākyaparityāgenā(parityāgena 
svādhikārānuguṇa gha ṅ ca cha ja) syādhikārānanuguṇotkṛṣṭaśāstreṇa 
pūjanaṃ vidadhāti prākpravṛttaśāstrānusāreṇa tairapi tatra pūjanasya yuktatvāt 
utkṛṣṭaśāstraniṣṭhānāmapyapakṛṣṭaśāstradharmeṣu lokānugrahārthaṃ 
(anugrahādyarthaṃ gha ja) pravṛtteḥ saṃhitāntarādisiddhatvasya prāgeva 
darśitatvāt |

yaccedamanantaramabhidhīyate (-)

vyāmiśrayāgamuktaistu tīvrabhaktisamanvitaiḥ |
sthāpitaṃ manujaindraistu niṣadvākādikovidaiḥ |
arcayed devadeveśaṃ divyaśāstroktavartmanā ||

iti idamapi divyaśāstreṇa sthāpitasthānaviṣayamanusaṃdheyam |

munivākyaparityāgapūrvakadivyamārgaparigrahavacanasya 
divyamārgapraśaṃsāparatvam 

itaṃ tvavaśiṣyate | yaduktam (-)

munivākyoktamārgeṇa pūjanaṃ yatra vartate |
tatrāpi divyamārgāccet pūjanaṃ kartumicchati ||

munivākyaṃ parityajya divyamārgeṇa pūjayet |
bhavet saṃnidhimāhātmyaṃ kālaṃ kalpakṣayāvadhi ||

divyamārgeṇa pūjādyaṃ vartate yatra nityaśaḥ |
tatra divyaṃ parityajya kadācicca mahāmate ||

munivākyoktamārgeṇa na kuryāt pūjanādikam |
kuryādvā yati vā mohādvipraḥ saṃmūḍhacetanaḥ(*) ||

(*)(sa vṛthārthaścirāt tasya bhaktibījena vai saha |
samantraṃ karma tantraṃ ca siddhayaśca parāṅmukhāḥ |
ihaiva śīghraṃ viprendra dehānte gatasaṃtatiḥ ||
iti ka ca ja jha pulstakeṣu adhikaḥ pāṭhaḥ |)

ghoraṃ prayāti narakaṃ rājā rāṣṭraṃ ca naśyati |
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena divyamārgaṃ ca na tyajet ||

iti (asyāpi ityārabhya na tyajediti iti paryantaṃ gha ṅ kośayoḥ na 
dṛśyate) asyāpi prāguktanyāyena divyamārgapraśaṃsāparatvaṃ suvyaktam 
tatrāpi iti apiśabdādiliṅgāt divyamārgaṃ tu na tyajet iti nigamanena tatraiva 
tātparyaviśramācca |

divyamārgaparigrahavacanānāṃ munivākyapūjitasvayaṃvyaktasthānaviṣayatvam

yadvā kālottaroktanyāyena vikalpataścaturvidhapūjāyogyaṃ svayaṃvyaktaṃ 
sthānam munivākyoktamārgeṇa pūjanaṃ yatra vartate ityanūdya tatrāpi 
divyamārgeṇa pūjanecchāyāṃ munivākyaparityāgena divyamārgeṇa 
pūjanamaviruddhamityucyate | na hyatra munivākyasthāpitasthāne kvacidapi 
divyamārgapraveśaḥ prastūyate api tu munivākyapūjita eva | sā ca munivākyena 
pūjā svayaṃvyakte'pi yati (yadyapi kha ga) pūrvaṃ varteta tatra kutaścit 
pramāṇāt svayaṃvyaktakṣetratve avasine sati munivākyaparityāgenāpi 
divyaśāstroktavidhinā divyaśāstrādhikāri pūjayedityuktaṃ bhavati |

śāstrasya divyādināmnā vibhāgaḥ

etena divyādyāyatananirṇayādhyāyoktaḥ prapañco'pi pratyuktaḥ | tathā hi (-)

divyādyāyatanānāṃ ca pūjādyaṃ yat tvayoditam |
śāstraṃ divyādibhedena yathādvaktumarhasi ||

iti sanakena pṛṣṭaḥ śāṇḍilyaḥ (iti pṛṣṭhaḥ sanakaḥ ka kha ga) 
vāsudevena yat proktaṃ śāstraṃ bhagavatā svayam ityādinā 
sākṣādbhagavatpraṇītaṃ brahmarudrendrapramukhaiḥ pravartitaṃ śāstraṃ 
divyamityuktvā

brahmarudramukhairdevaiḥ ṛṣibhiśca tapodhanaiḥ |
svayaṃ praṇītaṃ yacchāstraṃ tadviddhi munibhāṣitam ||

iti (brahmādibhirnirmitaṃ śāstraṃ munibhāṣitamiti ka kha ga jha kośeṣu na 
dṛśyate) brahmādibhirnirmitaṃ śāstraṃ munibhāṣitamiti vibhajya etattu 
trividhaṃ viddhi sāttvikādivibhedataḥ iti munibhāṣitasya traividhyaṃ prastutya 
sākṣādbhagavataḥ śrutārthamātranibandhanarūpaṃ śāstraṃ sāttvikam 
bhagavataḥ śrutamekadeśaṃ svayogamahimasiddhaṃ ca śeṣaṃ (aśeṣaṃ 
saṃkalayya brahmādibhistacchiṣyaiśca svayaṃ praṇītaṃ śāstraṃ rājasam 
(kevalasattvayoga ka kha ga jha) kevalasvayogavikalpotyairarthaiḥ kṛtaṃ 
śāstraṃ tāmasam iti munibhāṣitasya traividhyamuktvā devalaṃ manujairyattu 
kṛtaṃ tat pauruṣaṃ bhavet iti divyāt munibhāṣitācca 
(vyaktībhavadaprāmāṇyaṃ kha ga) vyatiriktaṃ 
saṃbhavaprāmāṇyamayogibhiḥ manujamātriaḥ praṇītaṃ pauruṣaṃ vākyaṃ 
pratipādya punardivyasāttvikarājasatāmasasaṃjñitāni pramāṇabhūtānyeva 
śāstrāṇi saṃhitāviśeṣaniyamenāpi vibhajya sāttvatapauṣkarajayākhyādīni 
śāstrāṇi divyāni 
īśvarabhāradvājasaumantavapārameśvaravaihāyasacitraśikhaṇḍisaṃhitājayottar
ādīni sāttvikāni sanatkumārapadmodbhava(pādmodbhava ka kha 
ca)śātātapatejodraviṇamāyāvaibhavikādīni rājasāni 
pañcapraśnaśukrapraśnatattvasāgarādīni tāmasānīti 
saṃhitāvibhāganirdeśānantaramucyate (-) 

saṃhitānāṃ divyasāttvikadibhedena vibhāgaḥ 

apakṛṣṭaśāstrasthāne utkṛṣtaśāstraparigrahavacanasya 
svayaṃvyaktasthānaparatvam

tāmasena tu mārgeṇa pūjādyaṃ yatra vartate |
tatrāpi rājasenaiva pūjādyaṃ siddhidaṃ bhavet ||

rājasena tu pūjādyaṃ vartate yatra nityaśaḥ |
tatrāpi sāttvikenaiva pūjadyaṃ śubhadaṃ sadā ||

sāttivikena tu pūjādyaṃ vartate yatra cānvaham (nityaśaḥ ka kha ga ca jha) 
|
tatra rājasamārgeṇa na kuryāt pūjanādikam ||

yatra rājasāmargeṇa na pravṛttaṃ tvarcanādikam |
tatra tāmasamārgeṇa na kuryādarcanādikam ||

vividhānāṃ rājasāmanyonyaṃ syānna saṃkaraḥ ||

iti |

munibhāṣiteṣu triṣu śāstreṣu utkṛṣṭamadhyamādhamaguṇa(guṇa ka kha jha 
ga kośeṣu nāsti) saṃjñānirdiṣṭheṣu 
apakṛṣṭaguṇasaṃjñitaśāstrapravṛttisthāne tatparityāgenāpi 
utkṛṣṭaguṇasaṃjñitaśāstreṇa pūjādyaṃ siddhidam | 
utkṛṣṭaguṇasaṃjñitaśāstrapravṛttisthāne tadviparītena śāstreṇa 
pūjanādikaṃ na kartavyam | (nanu samānaguṇasaṃjñitānāṃ ga; nanu 
guṇasaṃjñitānāṃ kha ca) samaguṇasaṃjñitānāṃ cānyonyaṃ na saṃkaraḥ 
kārya ityuktam | ihāpi yatra iti sāmānyena nirdiṣṭe'pi prāguktanyāyena 
prabhutānubhāvatayā sarvasahasvayaṃvyaktakṣetraviśeṣaviṣayatvaṃ mantavyam na 
tu sārvatrikatvam |

prākpravṛttākṛṣṭaśāstrapratyabhijñāne'pi divyasyāparityājyatvaṃ vā

yadvā cirakālaraṣṭarakṣobhādinā vicchinnapāraṃparyapratyabhijñāneṣu 
sthāneṣu kiṃkartavyatāmūḍhān prati pūrvamaprakṛṣṭaśāstrapravṛttāvapi 
tadajñānadaśāyā mupaplvābhisaṃdhyabhāvāt srvādhikāriṇāṃ 
mukhyānāmutkṛṣṭaśāstraparigraucityabhihocyate tatra punaḥ kutaścita 
pramāṇāt prākpravṛttaśāstraparijñāne divyasyāparityājyavaṃ ca | idaṃ ca 
tatrāpi ityativādaliṅgāt apiśabdāt sucyate | apiśabdasyātivādaliṅgatvaṃ 
caṇḍālamapi vṛttasthaṃ taṃ devā brāhmaṇaṃ viduḥ ityādiprayogeṣu 
prasiddham | ata eva hyatraiva punaḥ saṃkaraprihāre sarambhaḥ kriyate(-)

bhedaṃ divyādikaṃ samyagjñātvā sarvaṃ samācaret |
yo na jñātvā tu sāṃkaryān pūjādyamanutiṣṭhati ||

sa hi sarvasya jagataḥ sāṃkaryaṃ kurute sadā |
viśeṣāt svasya vaṃśasya tasmādāpadyapi dvijaḥ ||
na kuryācchāstrasāṃkaryaṃ hitaiṣī śāstrakovidaḥ ||

iti | ato yathokta evārthaḥ |

utkrṣṭaśāstraparigrahasya adhikāriviśeṣaviṣayatvaṃ vā

kicittu

munivākyoktamārgeṇa pūjanaṃ yatra vartate |
tatrāpi divyamārgāccet pūjanaṃ kartumicchati |
munivākyaṃ parityajya divyamārgeṇa pūjayet ||

ityādīnāṃ vacanānāmadhikāriviśeṣaviṣayatayā vyavasthāmichanti 
vyāmiśrayāmuktaistu tīvrabhaktisamanvitaiḥ iti prakramāt 
aitikāmuṣmikasāṃsārikaphalaviraktānām apavargāsannatamaśāstraparigrahasya 
yuktatvācca | tattattantroktasāṃsārikaphalasakttanāṃ tu yathāpūrvaṃ parigraha iti |

sāttvikādiśāstratrayamapi pramāṇameva

syānnāgaradrāviḍavesaraṃ (drāvalavaiśasaṃ ga śa) ca krameṇa vai 
sattvarajastamāṃsi |
mahīsurorvīpativaiśyakāste harirvidhātā hara ādidevaḥ ||

iti vimānakriyādiviṣayottamamadhyamatvādivivakṣayā (sattvādiguṇoktivat 
ihāpi tadvivakṣayā ka kha ga ṅ ca cha ja kośeṣu nāsti) sattvādiguṇoktivat 
ihāpi tadvivakṣayā tadguṇokteḥ pramāṇabhūtaśāstraviṣayeṣveva 
sāttvikarājasatāmasavibhāgasya yajante sāttvikā devān yakṣarakṣāṃsi rājasāḥ 
ityādibhirgavadgītāyāmapi pratipāditatvāt | apramāṇabhūtasya 
(aprāmāṇyasya ka kha ga cha ja jha) pauruṣasya tu vākyasya kevalaṃ 
manujairyattu krṭaṃ tat pauruṣam bhavet iti pṛthaṅ nirdeśāt |

sarvatra pauruṣe vākye tad grahyamavirodhi yat |
kevalaṃ tadvidhānena na kuryāt sthāpanadikam ||

iti hi pauruṣasaṃjñite vakye (viruddhaṃśasadbhāvaḥ ka kha ga ca jha) 
viruddhaviruddhaṃśasadbhāvo'tra darśitaḥ | ataḥ 
sāttivakarājasatāmasaṃjñāniveśo'tra 
sattvarajastamaḥprauratattatphalasiddhiviśeṣatāratamyābhiprāyeṇeti mantavyam |

kṛtsnaṃ pañcarātraṃ pramāṇaṃ 

kātsnyrena hi bhagavacchāstrasya prāmāṇyaṃ prāgeva partipāditam | na cātra 
bhagavadvyatiriktabrahmādipuruṣakrṭāṃśeṣu kāraṇadoṣaḥ saṃbhavati 
pañcarātrasya kṛṭṣnyasya vaktā nārāyaṇaḥ svayam iti svavaktṛke śāstre 
bhagavataiva teṣāmṛṣīṇāṃ tattatpuṇyaviśeṣānusāreṇa nitye'pi vede 
sutrakāṇḍamantrakṛttvavat saṃhitākartṛtvasyādhikāratayā samarpitatvāt | 
yathā ca vyāsokte mahābhārate vaiśampāyanasaṃhitābhedaḥ 
(saṃhitābhedaḥ gha ṅ cha ja) evamatrāpīti na saṃkaṭaṃ kiṃcit | ataḥ 
kṛtsnaṃ pañcarātraṃ pramāṇam | tasyāvāntarasaṃhitābhedaḥ 
ṛgādivaccaturdhāvasthitaḥ | tadvadeva yathādhikāraṃ vyavasthitānuṣṭhānatayā 
siddhantādisaṃkaraparihāreṇaiva sarvadanuvartanīyam | tathānuvartanaṃ 
(tathānuvartamānānāṃ ga gha śa cha ja; tathānurvartane ka jha) 
yathādhikāraṃ sākṣāt paraṃparayā vā 
sadbrahmavāsudevākhyaparamapuruṣārthaprāptisādhanamiti (prāptisūcanamiti 
ka kha) siddham |

pañcakālavyavasthityai veṅkaṭeśavipaścitā |
śrīpañcarātrasiddhantavyavastheyaṃ samarthitā ||

